  "worked_solution": "We calculate the derivative using the product rule, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(x\\operatorname{cot}\u2061(x)) \\\\  & =1\\operatorname{cot}\u2061(x)+x(-{csc}^{2}\u2061(x)) \\\\  & =\\operatorname{cot}\u2061(x)-x{csc}^{2}\u2061(x)\\end{aligned}\n$$",
